 indicate charging."}},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/fallbackMarkdown","o":"replace","v":"## How to set up an Apple MagSafe Charger\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Apple MagSafe Charger magnetic charging puck attached to back of iPhone\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\nApple's MagSafe Charger doesn't require Bluetooth pairing, an app, or special configuration. Just connect it to power and attach it magnetically to your compatible iPhone.\n\n1. **Connect the charger\\:** Plug the MagSafe Charger's USB-C cable into a compatible USB-C power adapter.\n2. **Plug into an outlet\\:** Connect the adapter to a wall socket.\n3. **Position your iPhone\\:** Place the back of your iPhone against the MagSafe Charger, with the magnetic charging surface facing the phone.\n4. **Check charging\\:** A charging animation should appear on your iPhone screen, and the battery icon should indicate charging.\n\nFor best results, use a MagSafe-compatible case or remove a thick or noncompatible case."},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/a588d0a9-b3f2-5d84-b96a-e7dbc7573701/state/is_loading","o":"replace","v":false},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/a588d0a9-b3f2-5d84-b96a-e7dbc7573701/state/images","o":"append","v":[{"url":"https://www.elespanol.com/omicrono/tecnologia/20250605/iphone-presumiria-potente-carga-inalambrica-prueban-cargadores-magsafe-filtrados/1003743791465_0.html","content_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/BmX5KyPKr1PX-IureVIQix6-dK6dQElYaPS2yhIBP0mCgG_OkVcSFn-LICYxBh8XLnh1FbdGgpKwU-YN8I_0J-7vkKcc9IzL8JPI-pBsbHh7OfpIUhzn1rlJfLVhYKDJR69mIWupRgJocVWuK2wSK1kGI4A_kBpGQOPaVVlGoOjg7LCuuIwMjCO-IcdnC_Kz?purpose=fullsize","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/chXCoEm3fppbUTE5JFHFqamCJzu0Ggku-VxUpxMBtfnFIeeDRexV8tjrLMbgy3SVAo6ZmePnNJgRqHiirvF7tlBxsGwP4kRu3gXxargqKaf5O-QEtKSvY47X-GKOv539jXR9CUWliucTgAQQXSVt4o5Tn84zG6bfEjiRx_5KmSk